Package: lissr
Title: Access, Download, Harmonize, and Merge LISS Panel Data
Version: 1.4.1.9000
Authors@R: person("Siard", "van den Bosch", email = "siardvandenbosch@me.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Programmatic access to the LISS Data Archive
    (<https://www.lissdata.nl/>). Authenticate with two-factor verification,
    browse available modules and waves, and interactively select and download
    longitudinal survey data. Schema-validated YAML recipes make variable
    harmonization, comparability rules, and validation checks explicit when
    merging LISS panel waves. Transformation logs, input-file hashes, and
    versioned provenance support reproducible research workflows. A rule-driven
    household-income cleaning framework produces decision ledgers and reports.
    Credentials are stored securely via the system keyring.
